{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 60,
    "dDurationMs": 4720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "From the top of this forty-five meter drop tower, my friends from the \"How Ridiculous\" YouTube channel"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5040,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are about to release a watermelon."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7360,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here we are."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 13620,
    "dDurationMs": 5460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In free fall for a full three seconds, the watermelon accelerates to over 100 kilometers per hour"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 19480,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "before smashing into the ground."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 27320,
    "dDurationMs": 5520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The results are predictable, but this was just a control for the actual experiment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 32840,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Another watermelon was sprayed with the polymer coating."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 35640,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Se'll come back to what this is and how it works,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 39560,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but for now, let's see how the coated watermelon fares in the drop test."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 48460,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's insane!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 53560,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[ laughing ]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 57120,
    "dDurationMs": 2780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Instead of shattering, the watermelon bounces"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 62180,
    "dDurationMs": 1660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and remains intact."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 64800,
    "dDurationMs": 1060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For the most part, anyway."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 70580,
    "dDurationMs": 1140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a definitly slushy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 72560,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Even with an axe, the \"How Ridiculous\" boys can't crack this shell."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 76860,
    "dDurationMs": 1020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How did it not?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 78360,
    "dDurationMs": 740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "AHH!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 79440,
    "dDurationMs": 800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[ laughter ]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 81460,
    "dDurationMs": 1180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "AAH YES"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 89580,
    "dDurationMs": 1360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Look it's actually!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 93260,
    "dDurationMs": 1300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Look at that!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 97300,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[ laughter ]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 103080,
    "dDurationMs": 1120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is amazing!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 104460,
    "dDurationMs": 4760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is pretty amazing that the watermelon could survive an impact of over 100km per hour!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 109220,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I went to find out more about the coating, called Line-X"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 112700,
    "dDurationMs": 1040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a mess!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 113740,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The individual components are a mess, when it goes on it goes on as a big mess"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 118020,
    "dDurationMs": 1720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you saw me wear a spray suit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 119980,
    "dDurationMs": 3220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a mess! And when you're done, you get some really cool stuff."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 124000,
    "dDurationMs": 4140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Line-X is made from two ingredients, A, and B."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 128560,
    "dDurationMs": 2420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Inside of each of these is multiple things."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 130980,
    "dDurationMs": 6140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the main component of A is Diphenylmethane-4,4'-diisocyanate, or MDI for short."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 137120,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's very reactive due to these groups on the end."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 139740,
    "dDurationMs": 5200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "B is the poly. The simplest way I could explain it is that it is a plasticizer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 145060,
    "dDurationMs": 9100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The main component of B is alpha- (2-aminomethylethyl) -omega- (2-aminomethylethoxy) -poly (oxy (methyl-1,- 2- ethanediyl))"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 154420,
    "dDurationMs": 3140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A long name for a long chain... molecule."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 157560,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In reality it would be many times longer than this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 160480,
    "dDurationMs": 5440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, I managed to convince Brin to let me mix the two ingredients the old fashioned way, with a stirr stick."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 166120,
    "dDurationMs": 880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's the A."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 167080,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm going to dump A and B in here and just mix them and see what happens."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 173180,
    "dDurationMs": 560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "-Ready?\n-Yup!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 176180,
    "dDurationMs": 880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Go for it!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 180480,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How quickly should they react?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 182240,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They are reacting right now!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 184380,
    "dDurationMs": 1120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Did you see that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 186980,
    "dDurationMs": 5880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is crazy! You can see there's almost, like... I don't know, smoke or something comming up there?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 192860,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's probably getting quite warm, I guess I could have gotten the thermometer out for you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 197860,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Feel the bottom and you tell me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 201740,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, that's very hot. It's like the bottom of a hot cup of coffee."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 207000,
    "dDurationMs": 4700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What's happening here is that the molecules of A and B are reacting to form long chains."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 211720,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Where they join, they form a urea group so the substance is called a polyurea."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 216840,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The structure of these chains is responsible for the properties of the coating."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 220520,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it's hard because it's made of a tangled mess of molecular threads."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 224200,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But flexible because these threads can be stretched out and then snap back into place."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 229320,
    "dDurationMs": 5400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Things you learn doing the reaction this way are that it's rapid, only taking seconds to react."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 234820,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it's exothermic - a lot of heat is given off as these bonds form."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 239220,
    "dDurationMs": 6500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But this ball of Line-X isn't really useful for much, so how do you mix A and B to form an effective coating?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 245860,
    "dDurationMs": 5440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Put them under really high pressure,  force them together in a really small space."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 251300,
    "dDurationMs": 5020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "High temperature, high pressure, just ram them into each other. That essentially mixes them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 256320,
    "dDurationMs": 2140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then they come out the end of the gun."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 258880,
    "dDurationMs": 8340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So from the time they're seperate components, they mix, out the gun, hit your target. Fraction of a second."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 267540,
    "dDurationMs": 1460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is where the magic happens"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 270060,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Inside here, see?\nPull the trigger, out comes Line-X"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 277640,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We decided to Line-X a piece of paper to see how strong the coating is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 287100,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As you can see it came out as a hot, high pressure liquid."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 290780,
    "dDurationMs": 1720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "-Ok, now..\n-How hot is that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 292800,
    "dDurationMs": 6400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's quite warm, and because that's an exothermic reaction it comes out at 150..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 299200,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But it keeps getting hotter and hotter."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 301660,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can probably rip it right now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 304740,
    "dDurationMs": 1120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There you go, Ok."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 305860,
    "dDurationMs": 5660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Those two chemicals just keep kinda looking for each other, or looking for something, so to speak."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 311520,
    "dDurationMs": 5840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Until every last molecule has found a home or given up looking. That could take a day or more."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 317360,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But there's plenty of opportunities to cross link right now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 321040,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So that's what it's doing. And that's where all the heat is coming from"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 323720,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's already dry, I'm not going to get any on me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 327380,
    "dDurationMs": 5300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's already cooling back down. So we've done the vast majority of curing and cross linking..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 333940,
    "dDurationMs": 1940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We're getting there right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 335880,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, it was harder."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 337480,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, we wait until some of this heat goes away."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 342800,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We're probably getting a good amount of curing going on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 346700,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is really tough to rip at this point"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 348660,
    "dDurationMs": 900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's strong stuff"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 352080,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That tensile strength will get you!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 355320,
    "dDurationMs": 5340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That high tensile strength is the same reason the Line-X coated watermelon bounces"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 367440,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As it hits the ground the contents of the watermelon are squeezed out sideways."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 372720,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the tangle of polyurea molecules pull together."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 375920,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Preventing the rind of the watermelon from deforming too much and breaking apart."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 380120,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the watermelon bounces instead of smashing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 384060,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This type of coating is now used in the walls of the Pentagon."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 388060,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Preventing exterior explosions from launching shrapnel into the building."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 391500,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The main cause of injury from explosions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 393860,
    "dDurationMs": 5800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it's used in bullet proof vests to contain bullet fragments that could cause serious injury."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 399660,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All of this is pretty incredible for a substance invented as a truck bed liner."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 404640,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, come on down! Bring your entire vehicle. Anything but your cat. We'll Line-X it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 411960,
    "dDurationMs": 3380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Massive thanks to the guys over at the \"How Ridiculous\" YouTube Channel!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 415340,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know, they are the ones that launched that basketball off the dam."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 418540,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is my most popular video."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 420280,
    "dDurationMs": 4620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And they have been doing some incredible experiments, like \"Bowling Ball vs Axe\"."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 425100,
    "dDurationMs": 3620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So go subscribe to their channel. Go do it right now!"
    } ]
  } ]
}
